{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_011_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:24693f6a8d4c17ed7c95518e4ea3fa9e679509001b5f913a3a0759da5848557f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a5677bb622a8c6358f1366e1c8b394fb039ac527e934c50768c1ad54acdacf",
      "text": "数年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f5d05f07137143bab39593f2d84263a2d3e255a3e1d7164f3bbf4f4259aebf",
      "text": "为什么不开花呢？\n我明明按照叔叔的做法浇了水啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68149ff341914fccace9a1e0d3084610af8a68268a04e5f047df734b1d21a004",
      "text": "哎，这边怎么枯了……！？\n明明放在了向阳的地方啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a42f2887d0071f90319c1e203e8ce0912b1d549ed81e44f7fd3ee413345ddec",
      "text": "花束到底该怎么做啊。\n总之先把好看显眼的花凑在一起扎起来看看吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:971a96435613c3159c569bc31d75df4c2d3b09fe0dbfd9db0d2684dfa9aa3ace",
      "text": "啊，花语！……完全没考虑到。\n糟了，前几天那束花的花语含义简直糟糕透顶啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd01e9aa51be72881fdda2f5bc3a66f9f6eaefdbfde34cb315429b20648199f",
      "text": "一开始什么都不懂，真的很辛苦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f181a5db1d3eafb7c4fed9b51078276d1022d85a6799885851f5c146ccb8a205",
      "text": "浇水的分量、对光照的喜好、扎花束的方法……\n有太多东西需要去学了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b762abc1e27b4f3a1643fec3734ab33f86d21823cd287d4ec40d0ddc20881b",
      "text": "不过，在这样不断接触的过程中，\n我就越来越喜欢花了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:679f89807b71e19a77000b016b7d24186d20129e2326044f8848a86009e612d6",
      "text": "实先生对花这么了解，\n正是出于对花朵的喜爱与努力的成果呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5079cbc103a9bb8ce6483117f03675044a984ad67afa5a8ec4c335a6ef83c7f4",
      "text": "是啊。而且，这也是叔叔……\n也是家里人喜欢的东西嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
